WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:18.140
Vhidhiyo iyi inotsanangura nzira yekugadzirira mwana naamai kana muchengeti vasati vaita fundal red reflex bvunzo muvana vachangozvarwa uye vana vakura.

2
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:29.140
Mwana anofanira kuchengetwa akachengeteka asi zvakanaka, pamakumbo, pafudzi, kana, kana mucheche, akarara nemanhede.

3
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:37.120
Zvakakosha kuti vanzwe vakachengeteka. Vacheche vacheche vanogona kusazororera uye vangada kuputirwa.

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.180
Kuongorora nguva pfupi mushure mekudya kunogona kubatsira sezvo vachange vakasununguka uye nehope shoma.

5
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Vana vakura vangagadzikana nokutamba nechitoyi kwenguva pfupi.

6
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:55.320
Taura nenzwi rine hushamwari uye edza kudzikira pachiyero cheziso ravo.

7
00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.500
Tsanangura zvauchaita uye uwane mvumo usati watanga.

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:10.440
Kutanga, bvunza amai kana mutarisiri kana vakaona chakaipa neziso romwana wavo kana kuona uye kuti vaona dambudziko racho kwenguva yakareba sei.

9
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.120
Zvadaro, tarisa chiso nemaziso zvomwana. Zvibvunze mimwe mibvunzo.

10
00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:24.300
Mwana anoita seane kurwadziwa muziso rimwe chete here? Maziso akavhurika here kana kuti ari kuavhara zvakasimba?

11
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:31.280
Pane kudiridza here kana kubuda mumaziso? Maziso acho akaenzana here? Maziso akazvimba here?

12
00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:38.580
Iye zvino, funga kuti mwana ari kuona sei. Fambisa chiso chako zvishoma nezvishoma kubva kune rumwe rutivi kuenda kune rumwe, uchiona maziso avo.

13
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:47.970
Ita kunyemwerera wakanyarara. Mwana anotevera kufamba kwechiso chako here kana kuti anopindura kunyemwerera kwako kwakanyarara?

14
00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:53.990
Zvakare, zvibvunze mimwe mibvunzo. Maziso ose ari maviri anofamba zvakasununguka uye pamwe chete here?

15
00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:01.110
Maziso akatwasuka here kana kuti rimwe ziso rakatarira mukati kana kunze? Maziso anodonha here?

16
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:12.200
Iwe unogona zvakare kushandisa mwenje paArclight uye mapikicha tarisiro kuti uwane kutariswa uye kuongorora kunaka kwechiratidzo.

17
00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:20.660
Fambisa rutivi rwakanangwa kuenda kudivi, kumusoro uye pasi. Tarisa uone kana mwana ari kugadzirisa uye kutevera chinangwa.

18
00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:26.600
Vanogona kusvika ndokunongedza zvakarurama here?

19
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:35.060
Kazhinji, ziso rimwe chete harigoni kuona zvakanaka. Iwe kana amai vanokwanisa kuvhara ziso rimwe, ipapo rimwe.

20
00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:43.320
Fambisa chinangwa uye enzanisa maitiro emwana paanenge achishandisa maziso ose, uye imwe panguva.

21
00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:51.380
Kana mwana asingadi kuti ziso rimwe chete rakavharwa, zvinoreva kuti ziso rakashama harione zvakanaka.

22
00:02:51.560 --> 00:03:00.560
Kana iwe uchifunga kuti unogona kuona chimwe chinhu chisina kunaka neziso rekunze, tarisa zvakanyanya uchishandisa iyo loupe yekupedzisira yeArclight.

23
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:12.150
Batidza mwenje uye uswedere pedyo nekutenderedza 6 cm. Ungangoda kushandisa chigunwe chako kuvhura zvinyoro nyoro zviziso.

24
00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:24.070
Zvibvunze mimwe mibvunzo. Chikamu chichena cheziso chepingi here kana chitsvuku? Mudzidzi kana cornea ipfumbu here kana chena?

25
00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:35.160
Mwana ari kutenderera here? Unogona kuona chero miviri yekunze? Iye zvino wagadzirira kuita iyo reflex bvunzo.
